<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Pre-Derm Society</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">

  <style>

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #111111;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      color: #111111;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    }

    .nav {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 20px 25px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    }

    .links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .links a {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1.7px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .links a:hover {
      opacity: 0.45;
    }

    .hero {
      max-width: 1100px;
      min-height: 82vh;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 110px 25px 100px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #777777;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(58px, 11vw, 125px);
      line-height: 0.88;
      letter-spacing: -6px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .hero-text {
      max-width: 600px;
      color: #666666;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .text-link {
      display: inline-block;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #111111;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1.6px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .text-link:hover {
      opacity: 0.45;
    }

    section {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 110px 25px;
    }

    .section-top {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.55fr 1.45fr;
      gap: 50px;
      padding-bottom: 55px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    }

    .label {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #777777;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 70px);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .section-text {
      max-width: 650px;
      color: #666666;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .explore-grid {
      margin-top: 55px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      border-top: 1px solid #dcdcdc;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dcdcdc;
    }

    .explore-card {
      padding: 35px 25px;
      min-height: 250px;
      border-right: 1px solid #dcdcdc;
    }

    .explore-card:last-child {
      border-right: none;
    }

    .card-number {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #888888;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }

    .explore-card h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .explore-card p {
      color: #666666;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .learning {
      background: #f7f7f7;
      max-width: none;
    }

    .learning-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 110px 25px;
    }

    .lesson {
      margin-top: 55px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
      padding: 50px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 70px;
    }

    .lesson-meta {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #777777;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .lesson h3 {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -2.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .lesson p {
      max-width: 580px;
      color: #666666;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .lesson-side {
      border-left: 1px solid #dddddd;
      padding-left: 40px;
    }

    .lesson-side .label {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .lesson-side p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .join {
      text-align: center;
      padding-top: 130px;
      padding-bottom: 130px;
    }

    .join h2 {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 15px auto 25px;
    }

    .join p {
      max-width: 550px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #666666;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .email {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #111111;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      padding: 55px 25px 35px;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1.7px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #111111;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .footer-note {
      font-size: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #888888;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .footer-copy {
      font-size: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #888888;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {

      .nav {
        padding: 18px 20px;
      }

      .links {
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 75vh;
        padding: 80px 22px;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: -4px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 80px 22px;
      }

      .section-top {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 25px;
      }

      .explore-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .explore-card {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #dcdcdc;
      }

      .explore-card:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }

      .lesson {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 32px;
        gap: 35px;
      }

      .lesson-side {
        border-left: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #dddddd;
        padding-left: 0;
        padding-top: 30px;
      }

      .learning-inner {
        padding: 80px 22px;
      }
    }

  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav>
    <div class="nav">

      <a href="index.html" class="logo">
        PRE-DERM SOCIETY
      </a>

      <div class="links">
        <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
        <a href="#explore">EXPLORE</a>
        <a href="#learning">LEARNING</a>
        <a href="#join">JOIN</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </nav>


  <header class="hero">

    <div class="hero-content">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        Student-led · Dermatology · Education
      </div>

      <h1>
        PRE-DERM<br>
        SOCIETY
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-text">
        An educational space for students interested in
        dermatology, skin science, medicine, and the path
        toward a career in dermatology.
      </p>

      <a href="#learning" class="text-link">
        Explore learning →
      </a>

    </div>

  </header>


  <section id="about">

    <div class="section-top">

      <div class="label">
        01 · About
      </div>

      <div>

        <h2>
          Start with<br>
          the science.
        </h2>

        <p class="section-text">
          Pre-Derm Society is a student-led educational
          platform designed to make dermatology and skin
          science approachable, structured, and interesting.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section id="explore">

    <div class="section-top">

      <div class="label">
        02 · Explore
      </div>

      <div>

        <h2>
          Foundations<br>
          first.
        </h2>

        <p class="section-text">
          Build a foundation in the science behind skin
          before exploring the broader world of dermatology.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="explore-grid">

      <div class="explore-card">

        <div class="card-number">01</div>

        <h3>Skin Science</h3>

        <p>
          Explore the structure, function, and biology
          of the skin.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="explore-card">

        <div class="card-number">02</div>

        <h3>Dermatology</h3>

        <p>
          Learn about the specialty and the many areas
          dermatologists study.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="explore-card">

        <div class="card-number">03</div>

        <h3>Medicine</h3>

        <p>
          Explore the academic journey and skills involved
          in pursuing medicine.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="learning" id="learning">

    <div class="learning-inner">

      <div class="section-top">

        <div class="label">
          03 · Learning
        </div>

        <div>

          <h2>
            Begin with<br>
            the basics.
          </h2>

          <p class="section-text">
            Short, focused lessons designed to introduce
            foundational concepts in skin science.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>


      <div class="lesson">

        <div>

          <div class="lesson-meta">
            Skin Science 01 · Foundations
          </div>

          <h3>
            The science<br>
            of skin.
          </h3>

          <p>
            A 10–15 minute introduction to the structure
            and function of skin, followed by a short
            knowledge check.
          </p>

          <a href="skin101.html" class="text-link">
            Begin lesson →
          </a>

        </div>


        <div class="lesson-side">

          <div class="label">
            Inside this lesson
          </div>

          <p>
            The basics · Skin structure · Three major layers
            · Skin function · Knowledge check
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="join" id="join">

    <div class="label">
      04 · Join
    </div>

    <h2>
      Interested in<br>
      learning with us?
    </h2>

    <p>
      Get in touch with Pre-Derm Society to learn more,
      share ideas, or find out how to get involved.
    </p>

    <a
      href="mailto:predermsociety@gmail.com"
      class="email">
      predermsociety@gmail.com
    </a>

  </section>


  <footer>

    <div class="footer-inner">

      <div class="footer-brand">
        PRE-DERM SOCIETY
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">

        <a
          href="https://www.tiktok.com/@prederm_society"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">
          TIKTOK
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/prederm_society"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">
          INSTAGRAM
        </a>

        <a href="mailto:predermsociety@gmail.com">
          EMAIL
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="footer-note">
        SKIN SCIENCE · DERMATOLOGY · EDUCATION
      </div>

      <div class="footer-copy">
        © 2026 PRE-DERM SOCIETY
      </div>

    </div>

  </footer>

</body>
</html>
